# RULE 29 — CURSOR = CLAUDE SHIP PARITY (owner 2026-08-02)

**Why:** Cursor PRs repeatedly failed `build-typecheck` while Claude's passed. Not bad luck. Cursor agents put Rule 16 in the **PR body**, used `git commit --no-verify`, skipped husky on bare/worktree clones, and learned lane bands / CLAIMED / EntityLink **after** CI burned 15–20 minutes. Claude writes **one complete commit** and runs the fail-fast gate **before** the first push.

## Mechanical tooth

`scripts/money-pr-local-gate.mjs` (first husky `branch:precheck-push` step) now runs **all** of:

1. `verify-definition-of-done-evidence` (every branch commit — labelled Rule 16 lines)
2. `verify-no-money-theater` (FINDING / LANE / DOD-A…E / VERIFY-1…8 / MODULE_PROGRESS / `MIGRATE:` when migrations touch)
3. `verify-no-parallel-scoreboard-prs`
4. `verify-section7-palette-financial`
5. `verify-migration-lane-band` — Cursor migrations **HH 12–23 only** (never `…0000` morning)
6. `verify-verify-step-lane-band` — Cursor verify-steps **EVEN only**
7. `verify-no-claimed-numbers-edits` — **never** edit `CLAIMED-NUMBERS.json` on a feature PR (filename is the claim — TOOL-F03)
8. `verify-data-migrations-rehearsed` — data-mutating migrations need a `REHEARSED:` line (TOOL-F04; Neon fork of prod)
9. `verify-entity-link-adoption` — bare UUID renders / baseline drift on frontend TSX
10. `verify-no-guard-file-deletion` — **Rule 30** — never soft-reset onto newer main (deletes others' verify-steps)
11. `verify-claude-green-evidence-shape` — **Rule 30** — tip LIVE PROOF is Claude-green (`exit 0` / sha), not `UNVERIFIED browser`

CI verify-steps **1324 + 1430 + 1702 + 1998 + 2088** remain the remote backstop. Local gate is the **primary** time-saver. Also: `node scripts/cursor-pr-body-gate.mjs --body-file …` before every `gh pr create|edit` (Rule 30).

## HARD agent law (non-negotiable)

| Always | Never |
|--------|-------|
| **One commit** over `origin/main` with the full labelled template in the **commit message** (not only the PR body) | Multi-commit "code then evidence" / prose-only first commit |
| Run `node scripts/money-pr-local-gate.mjs` and require **PASS** before every push (even if husky is missing) | Assume husky ran; push then watch CI |
| Keep git hooks enabled | `git commit --no-verify`, `git push --no-verify`, `HUSKY=0` |
| Cursor: migration `YYYYMMDDHHMM` with **HH 12–23**; verify-step **EVEN**; no CLAIMED json edit | HH 00–11, odd step numbers, CLAIMED-NUMBERS thrash |
| Fix EntityLink / regen baseline **in the same commit** when TSX changes fingerprint | Ignore `verify-entity-link-adoption` until CI fails |
| **One push** after local PASS; wait for green or a real fail log | Rebase/force-push while `build-typecheck` is in_progress |

## Commit message minimum (every app/db commit)

```
ROOT CAUSE: …
FIX: …
GUARD: scripts/verify-<name>.mjs + scripts/verify-steps/NNNN-verify-<name>.mjs
LIVE PROOF: …   OR   UNVERIFIED — <blocker>
REMAINING: …
```

Money paths also need FINDING / LANE / DOD-A…E / VERIFY-1…8 / MODULE_PROGRESS / MIGRATE (see Rule 23 / DoD §10).

## Autoload / deletion

Deleting this rule, shrinking `money-pr-local-gate` back to DoD-only, or removing verify-step **1998** fails CI.

## Tie-breakers

Busy < correct · PR body < commit message · husky hope < explicit local gate · another push < wait · memory < this file + `money-pr-local-gate`.
